cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
type: software
title: "IMPERANDI: IMaging PREprocessing And Normalization for Diagnostic Interoperability"
abstract: >-
  Python framework and command-line interface that turns heterogeneous DICOM
  collections into traceable, analysis-ready CT and MR imaging cohorts, with
  NIfTI conversion, segmentation, contrast-phase curation, registration,
  radiomics extraction and interactive quality control.
